  palette: {
    primary: { main: '#007bff' } 
  },
  typography: {
    button: {
      textTransform: 'none'
    }
  }
});
```  

9. Explore more advanced MUI components. Some other useful components include Drawer, Dialog, Snackbar, Stepper, Pagination, Pickers, etc.

