1. Sigmoid Function:
```c++
double sigmoid(double x) {
    return 1.0 / (1.0 + exp(-x));
}
```
2. Softmax Function:
```c++
double softmax(double* x, int n) {
    double sum = 0.0;

    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        sum += x[i] * log(x[i]);
    }

    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        x[i] = exp(sum - x[i] * x[i]);
    }

    return x;
}
```
3. ReLU Function:
```c++
double relu(double x) {
    return (x > 0.0) ? x : 0.0;
}
```
4. NAME_1 Function:
```c++
double NAME_1(double x) {
    return (x > 0.0) ? NAME_1(x) : -NAME_1(x);
}

