Note that this program uses a cursor to iterate through the records in the `` employees `` table, which can be a more efficient way to process large datasets than using a `` SELECT `` statement with `` LIMIT 4 ``. However, cursors can also be more complex to use and may require more error handling and exception handling than `` SELECT `` statements.

