```css
{
  "name": "my-package",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "devDependencies": {
    "esm": "^3.2.23"
  },
  "files": {
    "lib": "esm"
  }
}
```
The `files` property tells `esm` where to find your ESM files. In this example, the `lib` property is set to `esm`, which means that any files in the `lib` directory will be treated as ESM files.
